		(property "Part Origin" "TI TPS4811-Q1 SLUSEE5E physical pages 5-8,44,47-49; DGX0019A drawing 4226944/A 07/2021. Exact TPS48110 variant with OV, NC pin 11, omitted pin 16; not TPS48111. Footprint copper/mask/paste separately derived from manufacturer drawings. OCPM-generated in-house STEP using CadQuery and retained generate_tps48110.py; not manufacturer-supplied CAD. Body uses midpoint XY (3.0 x 5.1 mm), 1.1 mm maximum-height envelope, 0.1 mm representative standoff; simplified drafted/chamfered mold and bent leads, no internal die/bondwires or exact lead curvature. Lead width 0.22 mm midpoint of 0.165..0.275; 0.15 mm reference thickness; 4.9 mm representative span within 4.7..5.1. Review aid only, not assembly qualification."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
